                "message": "<i=3>FORCE AUGMENTATION</i>\n\nHigh Command has authorized auxiliary <i=1>SEAF infantry</i> to deploy alongside Helldivers on <i=1>Rirga Bay</i>.\n\nSEAF detachments will deploy to ongoing Helldiver missions as available to augment firepower and draw enemy aggression. SEAF troops report ecstatic morale at this opportunity to witness Helldiver lethality firsthand."
